# KPI Concepts

KPIs are measurable values used to evaluate system or service performance. Examples include availability, response time, error rate, throughput, latency, and utilization.

## Key Points

- Understand the purpose of kpi concepts.
- Identify relevant monitoring measurements.
- Use monitoring information for detection, analysis, and troubleshooting.

## Example Flow

```text
System → Collect Metrics → Analyze → Visualize → Alert → Respond
```
